WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.564
Now let’s add the regular costs that help a month work:

2
00:00:03.564 --> 00:00:09.590
utilities, phone, internet, groceries, savings, and

3
00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:11.297
anything else you want to include.

4
00:00:11.807 --> 00:00:14.432
Treat the starting estimates as placeholders and

5
00:00:14.432 --> 00:00:16.138
adjust them to fit your reality.

6
00:00:16.742 --> 00:00:18.576
There isn’t one right answer.

7
00:00:18.576 --> 00:00:20.062
You’re building a picture to learn

8
00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:22.477
from, not committing to a budget.
